    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d633-a4">

                <pb facs="0755" n="669" xml:id="pg669"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinelosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Governor of the federal
                            district to the secretary for foreign
                            affairs.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">mexican republic. government of
                        the federal district, section fifth, number</hi> 4848.</p>
                <p>Notwithstanding the efforts of the police to procure the arrest of Alfonso
                    Entrambasaguas, guilty of the murder of the American citizen Benjamin Garcia, it
                    has not been effected, for the reason that, according to information received
                    and already communicated to your Department, he has left the territory of the
                    federal district, but the orders to the police have been repeated, and the judge
                    of Tlalpam has been directed to take the measures indicated.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-10-16"><hi rendition="#italic">October 16,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Guillermo de Landa y
                    Escandon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
